To build the antlr library on mac:

```
# dynamic library
xcodebuild -project antlrcpp.xcodeproj -target antlr4 -configuration Release ARCHS="arm64 x86_64"

#static library
xcodebuild -project antlrcpp.xcodeproj -target antlr4_static -configuration Release ARCHS="arm64 x86_64"
```

To build the Arcscript transpiler:

```
xcodebuild -scheme ArcscriptTranspiler -project ArcscriptTranspiler.xcodeproj -configuration Release ARCHS="arm64 x86_64"
```